    "abstract": "Illustrated parts figure for the auxiliary power unit compartment firewall panel, the drain mast and the mount link hardware, showing the original and the reworked panel standards.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the compartment firewall panel, the cowl latch, the drain line clamp, the mount links and the anchor nut set in the auxiliary power unit compartment.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the compartment looking forward with the panel in place; sheet 2 shows the panel removed with the frame land and the drain mast position visible. The reworked panel has a formed lower edge and a drain mast position forty millimetres aft of the original, so the two panels are not interchangeable and the mast aperture on an unmodified frame will not accept the reworked mast."
    },
